    <div id="__nuxt"><!----><div id="__layout"><div><div class="ai-guide-container" lang="en-US"><iframe src="cid:frame-5D444894667262B8E995F7CBD6F6A2F2@mhtml.blink" frameborder="0" width="100%" height="100%" class="doc-iframe"></iframe> <div data-v-d8284756="" class="ai-guide-header"><div data-v-d8284756="" class="doc-title">FRESHPLAN_PROJECT_WORK.docx.docx</div> <div data-v-d8284756="" class="edit-icon"></div> <button data-v-d8284756="" class="edit-button">Edit on PC</button></div> <!----> <button data-v-917655e0="" class="wps-ai-button"><span data-v-917655e0="" class="ai-icon"></span>
  WPS AI
</button> <div data-v-05306c57="" data-v-7ae10e52="" class="no-scrollbar popup-container hide"><div data-v-7ae10e52="" data-v-05306c57="" class="edit-with-wps-footer"><div data-v-7ae10e52="" data-v-05306c57="" class="footer-title">Edit in WPS Office</div> <div data-v-7ae10e52="" data-v-05306c57="" class="footer-content">Free Version of Office with PDF Editor</div> <div data-v-7ae10e52="" data-v-05306c57="" class="footer-buttons"><button data-v-7ae10e52="" data-v-05306c57="" class="footer-button no-btn">No Thanks</button> <button data-v-7ae10e52="" data-v-05306c57="" class="footer-button open-btn">Open in APP</button></div></div></div> <div data-v-05306c57="" data-v-2cb62af8="" class="no-scrollbar popup-container hide"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-title-wrapper"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-title"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="color-title-wrapper"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="ai-icon background-image"></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="color-title">WPS AI</div></div></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-image background-image"></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="close-icon background-image"></div></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-content"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-hint"><span data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="line"></span> <span data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="hint-text">Get WPS AI on PC</span> <span data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="line"></span></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-links"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-link"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-icon background-image" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/mailToMe.13bb59a.svg&quot;);"></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-title">Email Me</div></div><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-link"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-icon background-image" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/email.6ff5365.svg&quot;);"></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-title">Email</div></div><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-link"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-icon background-image" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/whatsapp.0f25c4c.svg&quot;);"></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-title">WhatsApp</div></div><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="banner-link"><div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-icon background-image" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/messenger.acae0f2.svg&quot;);"></div> <div data-v-2cb62af8="" data-v-05306c57="" class="link-title">Messenger</div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-05306c57="" data-v-22bb31f4="" class="no-scrollbar popup-container hide"><div data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="popup-title">Done! Now you can check the file on PC</div> <div data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="popup-content">If you do not have the PC version, file transfer is not available. Edit on PC by the following steps:</div> <div data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="step"><div data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="step-text"><span data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="step-number">1. </span>Click here to <span data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="emphasis">Get WPS Office for PC</span>, or download it from wps.com.</div> <img data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" alt="step1" src="https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/pcStep1.b4c3a12.svg" class="step-image"></div> <div data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="step"><div data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="step-text"><span data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="step-number">2. </span>Sign in with your current account on the PC, and open files in WPS Drive.</div> <img data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" alt="step2" src="https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/pcStep2.c8326a5.svg" class="step-image"></div> <button data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="get-wps-btn">Get WPS Office for PC</button> <button data-v-22bb31f4="" data-v-05306c57="" class="got-it-btn">Got It</button></div> <div data-v-05306c57="" data-v-c6ea0d12="" class="no-scrollbar popup-container hide"><div data-v-c6ea0d12="" data-v-05306c57="" class="popup-title">Send to Your Email</div> <div data-v-c6ea0d12="" data-v-05306c57="" class="popup-content">Couldn't find an email address linked to your account. Enter a valid email address to receive messages.</div> <div data-v-c6ea0d12="" data-v-05306c57="" class="line"></div> <div data-v-c6ea0d12="" data-v-05306c57="" class="input-label">Enter your email address</div> <input data-v-c6ea0d12="" data-v-05306c57="" type="email" placeholder="Email (required)" class="email-input"> <!----> <button data-v-c6ea0d12="" data-v-05306c57="" class="submit-btn">Submit</button></div> <div data-v-05306c57="" data-v-079b0c27="" class="no-scrollbar popup-container hide"><div data-v-079b0c27="" data-v-05306c57="" class="popup-title">Check Email on Your PC</div> <img data-v-079b0c27="" data-v-05306c57="" alt="mail" src="https://global-static.wpscdn.com/cms/docs/img/mail.079e0e5.svg" class="mail-image"> <div data-v-079b0c27="" data-v-05306c57="" class="popup-content">The download link will be sent to your email address: <span class="emphasis"></span>.</div> <button data-v-079b0c27="" data-v-05306c57="" class="got-it-btn">Got It</button></div></div></div></div></div>
  

</body></html>
